            <ArticleTitle>[Fibrinolytic activity of rat blood during transient coronary insufficiency].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>552-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Local 10-min and 40-min myocardial ischemia was accompanied by a significant depression in the rat blood fibrinolytic activity. During 40-min postischemic myocardial reperfusion after short-term (10-min) myocardial ischemia fibrinolytic reactions were activated and after prolonged (40-min) myocardial ischemia they were suppressed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
